<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Site Visit Assigned — Sanmar Properties</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #F5F0EB; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: #1A1614; padding: 28px 32px; }
    .header img { height: 32px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; color: #1A1614; font-weight: 600; }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .badge-new      { background: #FEF3C7; color: #92400E; }
    .badge-existing { background: #D1FAE5; color: #065F46; }
    .badge-referral { background: #EDE9FE; color: #5B21B6; }
    .detail-box { background: #FAF7F4; border: 1px solid #E8DDD0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .detail-row { display: flex; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE9E1; font-size: 13px; }
    .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .detail-label { color: #826B52; font-weight: 600; width: 110px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .detail-value { color: #1A1614; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #FAF7F4; border-top: 1px solid #E8DDD0; font-size: 12px; color: #999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="https://sanmar-meeting-system-production.up.railway.app/logo.svg" alt="Sanmar Properties" />
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Site Visit Assigned to Your Team</h2>
      <p>Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
      <p>A site visit has been routed to your team based on the client profile. Please review the details and coordinate accordingly.</p>

      {{#if isNew}}
        <span class="badge badge-new">🆕 New Client</span>
      {{else if isReferral}}
        <span class="badge badge-referral">👥 Referral</span>
      {{else}}
        <span class="badge badge-existing">🔄 Existing Client</span>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="detail-box">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Client</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{clientName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Site</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{siteName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Date</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{visitDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Time</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{visitTime}}</span>
        </div>
        {{#if partySize}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Party Size</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{partySize}} person(s)</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if assistanceContact}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Via / Assisted By</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{assistanceContact}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Booked By</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{bookedByName}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>Please ensure all preparations are completed before the visit and confirm attendance with the client if needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Sanmar Properties — Internal notification. Do not reply to this email.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
